{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-dm-recovery-readiness",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "private": true,
  "author": "Shiyuedong-Jade",
  "description": "达梦 DM8 数据库可恢复能力评估插件：注册 dm_recovery_readiness 工具，按 16 个恢复场景（逻辑损坏 / 物理损坏 / 集群容灾）逐项对照「要求 vs 本库实际」，给出五档能力判定与针对性建议；含归档链逐段核对、未归档尾部、可回溯起点、时间 ↔ LSN 夹逼与备份可用性核对，生成 HTML 报告与 findings.json。只读设计：不扫描、不修复、不改配置。",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Shiyuedong-Jade/DM-recovery.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Shiyuedong-Jade/DM-recovery#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Shiyuedong-Jade/DM-recovery/issues"
  },
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets",
    "tools",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "screenshots.json",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "smoke": "node tools/smoke.mjs",
    "selftest": "node tools/triage.mjs selftest",
    "live": "node tools/live-check.mjs",
    "peer-range": "node tools/peer-range.mjs",
    "shots": "node tools/shots.mjs"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": ">=4.0.1-0 <4.1.0-0 || >=4.0.5-0 <4.1.0-0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.1.0-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.1-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.2-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.3-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.4-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.5-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.6-0 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.1.7-0 <0.2.0-0"
